## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear supplies the sound system, also called a PA system, for private parties, weddings and corporate events across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. Every booking is delivered, installed and tested on site by our own crew, with a technician included on our larger packages.

Pricing is real and published, not a quote only form: from the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) at 290 euros for up to 50 guests, up to the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) at 490 euros for up to 120 guests. [Contact us](/contact/) to match a package to your guest count and venue.

