## Choosing Your Sound System by Guest Count

A sound system that works for 40 guests in a boardroom will not reach 120 guests in a conference hall, and a system built for a wedding speech is not the same as one built for a DJ set. Instead of working out wattage yourself, match your guest count to the package that already covers it:

| Package | Guest capacity | Sound equipment | Technician | Price (ex VAT) |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) | Up to 50 | 2 active speakers with stands, 1 wired dynamic microphone, 2 RGBW LED light bars | Not included | 290 euros |
| [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) | Up to 40 | Basic sound reinforcement system, 1 professional gooseneck microphone | Available as a paid add on | 295 euros |
| [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) | Up to 80 | High end active PA acoustic sound system, wireless microphones for speeches | Included | 650 euros |
| [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) | Up to 120 | Premium active sound system, 1 gooseneck plus 1 wireless handheld microphone | Included, up to 6 hours | 490 euros |

All prices are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown. See live pricing and full inclusions on our [packages page](/packages/).

