## PA System or DJ Sound: Matching Equipment to the Event

A PA system reinforces whatever is going into the microphone or the mixer, but what it needs to reinforce is different for a party and for a speech.

For a DJ set, a live band or a small party, the need is a self contained PA sound setup that a DJ or band can plug into and run themselves. Our [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) covers exactly that speaker rental need, with 2 active speakers, a wired microphone for announcements, and no technician on site, so the DJ controls their own set. Our [audio visual rental for music performances](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-music-performances/) guide covers this setup in more detail.

For a wedding speech, a boardroom address or a conference panel, the priority shifts to speech clarity: a wireless or gooseneck microphone that will not cut out or feed back, paired with a technician who adjusts levels live. That is what the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) are built for.

## What's Included in a Sound System Rental

What is actually in the box depends on the package, not a blanket rule:

-   **Eco Pack**: 2 high quality active speakers with stands, 1 wired dynamic microphone, 2 light bars with RGBW LED spotlights, plus aesthetic cabling and professional setup. No technician on site.
-   **Basic MICE Pack**: a basic, crystal clear sound reinforcement system for up to 40 people, 1 professional gooseneck microphone for the podium, and logistics transport and setup. A dedicated on site live technical assistant is available as a paid add on.
-   **Wedding Pack**: a high end active PA acoustic sound system for up to 80 guests, professional wireless microphones for speeches and announcements, transport, professional aesthetic setup and cabling, and on site live technical control for the duration of the event.
-   **MICE Pack**: professional active speakers and a high performance sound system, 1 gooseneck plus 1 wireless handheld microphone, and a dedicated specialized live AV technician for up to 6 continuous hours.

Whichever package you choose, our crew handles delivery, installation and testing before your event starts, and returns afterward to collect everything. See the full step by step process in our [how audio visual rental works](/blog/how-audio-visual-rental-works/) guide.

## Equipment We Use: Active PA Speakers, Line Array and Shure Microphones

Across our catalog, the sound side of our inventory covers line array systems and active speakers for larger rooms and outdoor spaces, digital mixing consoles for live control, and Shure microphones for high acoustic fidelity on the packages that include one. The microphone itself depends on the package: a wired dynamic microphone on the Eco Pack, a gooseneck podium microphone on the Basic MICE Pack, and a wireless handheld microphone on the Wedding Pack and MICE Pack. The exact model deployed on your booking depends on guest count and venue, which is why we size it to the package table above rather than a single generic setup.

