## Indoor and Outdoor Sound System Rental

Most of the sound system bookings we deliver are on villas, private terraces and hotel ballrooms across Malaga and the Costa del Sol, indoors and outdoors alike. Our Eco Pack is specced for villas, gardens and private rooms, and our Wedding Pack for villas, fincas and wedding hotels, which reflects where these systems actually get used.

We do not publish a generic weatherproofing claim, because the honest answer depends on your specific venue. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue details, indoor or outdoor, and we will confirm the right setup for it.

## How Far in Advance to Book

Book as early as you can once your event date is confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, when technicians and the most requested packages fill up first. Corporate bookings tied to a fixed conference date should also lock in the package early rather than wait for a final headcount.

## Conclusion

A sound system rental is only as good as its match to your guest count and your event type. From a self run PA for a DJ set on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), up to a technician managed setup on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) or [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs, tests and collects the equipment so you never have to. [Contact us](/contact/) to match a package to your event. For our full audio visual rental range, see the [audio visual rental page](/blog/audio-visual-rental/).

## FAQs

### What is included in a sound system rental?

It depends on the package. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) includes 2 active speakers with stands, 1 wired dynamic microphone and 2 RGBW LED light bars, with no technician. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) includes a basic sound reinforcement system and 1 gooseneck microphone, with a technician available as a paid add on. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes a high end active PA sound system, wireless microphones and a technician. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes a premium sound system, gooseneck and wireless handheld microphones, and a technician for up to 6 hours. See [What's Included in a Sound System Rental](#whats-included-in-a-sound-system-rental) above for the full breakdown.

### Do I need a PA system for a DJ set, or something different for a speech heavy event?

Both use a PA system, but the setup differs. A DJ set or party is served well by a self run PA system, like our [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), with a wired microphone for announcements and no technician. A speech heavy wedding, boardroom address or conference panel needs a wireless or gooseneck microphone paired with a technician managing levels live, which is what the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) are built for.

### Do you provide a technician with the sound system?

Only on some packages. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is delivery, setup and teardown only, with no technician on site. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) offers a technician as a paid add on. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) include a live technician as standard, with the MICE Pack technician on site for up to 6 continuous hours. For the full breakdown of what that technician actually does on site, and how to book one specifically, see our [AV technician hire](/blog/av-technician-hire/) guide.

### Do you provide a generator or backup power for the sound system?

No. None of our packages include a generator or backup power supply. If your venue, especially an outdoor villa or terrace, has uncertain mains power, confirm this with us when you request your quote so we can plan the setup around your venue's actual power supply.

### How far in advance should I book a sound system rental?

Book as early as you can once your event date is confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, when technicians and the most requested packages fill up first. See [How Far in Advance to Book](#how-far-in-advance-to-book) above.

### Can you set up a sound system outdoors, or only indoors?

Yes, both. Most of the sound systems we deliver go into villas, private terraces and hotel ballrooms across Malaga and the Costa del Sol, indoors and outdoors alike. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue details so we can confirm the right setup for it.

### Is a PA system rental the same as a sound system rental?

Yes, for our packages the two terms describe the same equipment. We use "PA system" and "sound system" interchangeably throughout this guide, and every package above is a PA system rental: a self run PA on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) for a DJ set or party, or a technician managed PA on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) or [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) for a speech heavy event. There is no separate PA system rental product or pricing tier.

### Do you offer a portable, battery powered or self collect PA system?

No. Every package we offer is delivered, installed, tested and collected by our own crew, never a self collect or self return unit, and none of our packages run on battery power. If a specific venue has uncertain mains power, [contact us](/contact/) with the details and we will plan the setup around it rather than offer a battery powered substitute we don't stock.

### Can I rent just speakers, without a microphone or technician?

Not as an a la carte item. Our closest match for a speaker rental with no technician is the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/): 2 active speakers with stands, self run, no technician on site, but it's a fixed package that also includes 1 wired dynamic microphone and 2 LED light bars rather than speakers sold on their own. [Contact us](/contact/) if your event genuinely needs speakers only, and we'll confirm what's possible.

### What type of microphone do I need for my event?

It depends on the package. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) includes 1 wired dynamic microphone for announcements. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) includes 1 professional gooseneck microphone for a podium or lectern. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) include a wireless handheld microphone for speeches, with the MICE Pack adding a gooseneck microphone as well. We also stock wireless lavalier and headset microphones as a separate item from these package inclusions: [contact us](/contact/) if your presenter or performer needs a hands free mic.

### Is a wireless microphone available, or only wired?

Both, depending on the package. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) uses a wired dynamic microphone. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) include a wireless handheld microphone instead, which is what most speeches and awards style presentations need.

### Can I rent an audio mixer or mixing console on its own?

No. Our digital mixing consoles are technician operated equipment built into the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), not a standalone rental item. On the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), a DJ or band brings and runs their own mixer or controller, as covered in our [audio visual rental for music performances](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-music-performances/) guide.

### Do you rent audio interfaces for recording or podcasting?

No. We don't stock recording or podcasting style audio interfaces. For presentations, we provide HDMI and USB-C adapters to connect your laptop or tablet, and our packages include a digital mixing console for live sound, not studio recording gear.
